---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import RoutePreview from "../components/RoutePreview.astro";
import Features from "../components/Features.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Layout title="ppmlx — your apps, your models, your routes" description="Connect your AI tools to custom model routes. Set provider policies, run local MLX models, and keep a lightweight context graph on your Mac.">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main-content">
    <Hero />
    <RoutePreview />
    <Features />
    <section class="container" id="memory" aria-labelledby="memory-title">
      <div class="memory-section">
        <div><p class="section-label">Private memory, shared by choice</p><h2 id="memory-title">Change the model.<br />Keep the useful context.</h2><p>Your project context should not belong to one provider. ppmlx keeps facts, relationships, and their sources in a lightweight local graph.</p><p>Apps can read selected context with an explicit grant. You control which tools can read it and which project they can read.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx#memory-read-endpoints">Explore the memory graph</a></div>
        <div class="memory-map" aria-label="Your apps read selected context from a local graph on your Mac">
          <div class="graph-apps"><span>Coding agent</span><span>Chat app</span></div>
          <div class="graph-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="read-label">Explicit read access</p>
          <div class="graph-store"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 220 76" fill="none"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".35"><path d="M29 38 80 17 137 41 190 19M29 38 85 62 137 41 190 62M80 17 85 62M137 41 190 19"/></g><g fill="var(--bg-surface)" stroke="currentColor"><circle cx="29" cy="38" r="5"/><circle cx="80" cy="17" r="4"/><circle cx="85" cy="62" r="4"/><circle cx="137" cy="41" r="6"/><circle cx="190" cy="19" r="4"/><circle cx="190" cy="62" r="4"/></g></svg><strong>Your context graph</strong><span>Stored on your Mac</span></div>
          <p class="memory-note">Experimental. Memory capture is off by default.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="container section" id="quickstart" aria-labelledby="start-title">
      <div class="start-section"><div><h2 id="start-title">Make it your own.</h2><p>Install ppmlx, connect your tools, and set your first route. Add provider credentials or download a local model.</p><div class="start-links"><a class="btn-primary" href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx#install">Read the setup guide</a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx">View source</a></div><p class="requirements">macOS on Apple Silicon. Python 3.11–3.12.</p></div><div class="start-code"><span>After installation</span><pre tabindex="0" aria-label="Set up ppmlx and start the server"><code><span class="code-comment"># Connect your apps</span>
ppmlx onboard

<span class="code-comment"># Configure your model routes</span>
ppmlx route

<span class="code-comment"># Start your endpoint</span>
ppmlx serve</code></pre></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="container" aria-label="Project information"><div class="project-line"><p>Built in the open. Yours to inspect, change, and run.</p><div><a href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">Changelog</a><a href="https://github.com/wydrox/ppmlx/issues">Issues</a><a href="/turboquant">Experiments</a></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
<style>
.memory-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 64px; border-block: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-block: var(--section-gap); }
.memory-section h2 { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.memory-section p:not(.section-label) { font-size: 14px; max-width: 460px; }
.text-link { font: 12px/1.7 var(--font-mono); text-decoration: none; }
.text-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.memory-map { max-width: 340px; width: 100%; justify-self: end; text-align: center; }
.graph-apps { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 16px; }
.graph-apps span { font: 11px/1.5 var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-secondary); padding: 9px 13px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--bg-surface); }
.graph-line { height: 28px; width: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 0 auto; }
.read-label { font: 10px/1.5 var(--font-mono) !important; margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--text-dim); }
.graph-store { border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 15px 24px 20px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg-surface); }
.graph-store svg { display: block; width: 220px; height: 76px; margin: 0 auto 8px; color: var(--accent); }
.graph-store strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
.graph-store span { display: block; color: var(--text-dim); font: 10px/1.8 var(--font-mono); margin-top: 4px; }
.memory-note { margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 10px !important; color: var(--text-dim); }
.start-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; }
.start-section p { max-width: 430px; font-size: 14px; }
.start-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; margin-top: 26px; }
.requirements { font-size: 11px !important; margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--text-dim); }
.start-code { min-width: 0; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--bg-surface); }
.start-code > span { display: block; padding: 12px 20px; font: 10px/1.8 var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-dim); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
pre { padding: 18px 20px; margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; } pre code { font-size: inherit; } .code-comment { color: var(--text-dim); }
.project-line { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-block: 28px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
.project-line p { font-size: 12px; margin: 0; }
.project-line div { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.project-line a { color: var(--text-secondary); font: 11px/1.7 var(--font-mono); text-decoration: none; }
.project-line a:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }
@media(max-width: 720px) { .memory-section, .start-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; } .memory-map { justify-self: center; } }
</style>
